==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use high ranged units such as [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] to slowly chip down Le'Behemoth. Although not required, if one has a unit with [[Shield Piercing]] such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]], bringing it will help speed up the fight against Le'Behemoth. For the peons, using area attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] or nukers like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime]] should be enough.

